 ric Entry\n\n13.10–13.50\nAkseli Väliviita (Aalto University) — A Poo
 r Man’s Nodal Market: Pricing Network Operating…\n\n14.00–14.30 Co e
 e break\n\n14.30–15.00\nTheo Herold (Hanken) — Switching Costs and Str
 ategic Pricing in the Auditing Industry …\n\n15.00–15.40\nMikko Vanhal
 a (University of Helsinki) — Consumer Search in the Stock Market\n\n15.4
 0–16.10\nVeera Nippala (University of Helsinki) — Innovation-by-Doing 
 - the E ect of Prior Production…\n\n16.10–16.40\nJoakim Wikström (Aal
 to University) — Biased Standards? Patents\, and the Merits of Coordinat
 ed…\n\nTimes read from the programme.\n\nFull programme: https://www.hel
